<title>USA: Argosy Gaming Co Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Argosy Gaming Co Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>ALTON, Ill. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.34   profit	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net loss		   8,349   profit	   896</p>
<p> Revs			58,839		   60,518</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.64   profit	 $0.37</p>
<p> Net loss		  15,480   profit	 9,033</p>
<p> Revs		     244,817		  252,691</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: After one-time charges, referendum costs and pre-opening costs, Q4 loss was $11.2 million, or $0.46 a share, compared with a profit of $518,000, or $0.02, while 1996 loss was $24.8 million, or $1.02, compared with profit of $7.0 million, or $0.29.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
